- Schema definition
- Schema synchronization/dropping
- 1:1, 1:M & N:M Associations
- Through models
- Promises
- Hooks/lifecycle events
- Prefetching/association including
- Transactions
- Migrations
- CLI ([sequelize-cli](https://github.com/sequelize/cli))

